  "summary": "101.6 x 53.3 mm. Keeps the Uno hole positions so Uno shields still fit.",
  "confidence": "datasheet",
  "source": "Arduino MEGA 2560 Rev3 reference design (Arduino, Eagle board file): board 101.6 x 53.34 mm with the notched right end, six 3.2 mm holes at (13.97, 2.54), (15.24, 50.8), (66.04, 7.62), (66.04, 35.56), (90.17, 50.8) and (96.52, 2.54). The first four match the Uno, which is why Uno shields bolt on. Headers along y 2.54 and 50.8 plus the 2 x 18 header for pins 22 to 53 at x 93.98. USB-B and DC jack as on the Uno. Part positions in the look come from the same file; resistors and small capacitors are left out.",
